      "message": "I still need to take a closer look at the change later, but after quick glance I think I agree with Peter K.s comments. One high level question I have is, I assume this check will start eventually start getting enforced in Chrome builds? If so can you enable the same checks in Skia\u0027s gn files or else I feel like we could end up breaking this and not knowing until we try to land into Chrome.",
